            "review_title": "Review at Tom's Bar",
            "review_text": "Emily C\n7 contributions\n0\nViolent worker\nApr 2026 • Friends\nMe and my friend decided to go into this bar, we went straight to the toilet because we needed it, before we know we’re getting screamed and the door bashed on. The lady working there believed we weren’t going to buy a drink (we were we love beer lol) we head to the bar with her and she’s still screaming, when I say she’s being rude she starts swearing and shoves me into the bar by my chest. I’ve never ever been treated like this in my life.\nThe next day she’s swears and me and growls as I walk down the street, very strange intimidating behaviour. Would highly recommend the bars nearby who all treated me and my friends very well and are much more lively.\nRead more\nWritten April 15, 2026",
